# Copy to `.env` and fill in values. Do not commit real API keys.

# Optional: override public origin for staging previews (defaults to https://maeum.co.uk).
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://staging.example.com

# Waitlist API base (no trailing slash). In `npm run dev`, leave unset to use Vite's `/api` proxy to `server.mjs`.
# For production static hosting (Hostinger, etc.), either set this to your Worker URL or rely on the
# default in `src/lib/site.ts` (`MAEUM_WAITLIST_API_ORIGIN`) — then rebuild so the browser calls the Worker.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-worker.workers.dev

# CORS is enforced on the Cloudflare Worker, not in this repo. Deploy `cloudflare/waitlist-worker.js`
# (or add https://maeum.co.uk and https://www.maeum.co.uk to your existing worker allowlist).
